bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][b][i]Help[/i][/b][/center]
[u][b]How to play[/b][/u]
[ul]To move[/ul]
      -use the WASD or Arrow Keys

[ul]To pause[/ul]
	  -click the spacebar
	  -or use the pause button on screen

[ul]To restart[/ul]
	  -click the \"R\" key
	  -or use the pause menu

[u][b]Game Navigation[/b][/u]
[ul] Your light is fading away to refill it you need to collect sparks.
Your light is both your life and weapon.
move arround to locate some sparks
move towards and collide with the spark
once you collide the spark will disappear and you will be rewarded
Yes you're not alone the omens of the abssy seek your light and will quench it on contact though they die
So when your light is in dire fading better run 
Repeat the steps and accumulate sparks"

